PN,39501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FWatch Kris Jepson's exclusive
OL,8,Finterview with the Port of Tyne chief
OL,9,Fexecutive, Matt Beeton, in his first
OL,10,Finterview since the plastic nurdle
OL,11,Fspill
OL,13,FThe chief executive of the Port of
OL,14,FTyne has told ITV News Tyne Tees that
OL,15,F17 tonnes of plastic nurdles spilled
OL,16,Ffrom containers on a ship within just
OL,17,F"five seconds", in an accident
OL,18,Finvolving two vessels on Sunday 19
OL,19,FJuly.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FThe Wind Orca hit the berthed BG
OL,8,FOrange, causing damage to containers
OL,9,Fthat led to millions of the plastic
OL,10,Fpellets entering the river and then
OL,11,Fthe sea, in what has been dubbed as
OL,12,FEurope's worst plastic pollution
OL,13,Fincident of its kind.
OL,15,FWhile ITV News cannot independently
OL,16,Fverify events, the Chief Executive of
OL,17,Fthe port, Matt Beeton, described for
OL,18,Fthe first time what unfolded, from his
OL,19,Fperspective.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FHe said: "As the Wind Orca moved away,
OL,8,Fit hit the side of the BG Orange and
OL,9,Fwent right down the side of the BG
OL,10,FOrange. In doing so, cutting holes in
OL,11,Fthe hull, and ripping open some of the
OL,12,Fcontainers as well. Two of those
OL,13,Fcontainers had nurdles in, it sliced
OL,14,Fthem open, damaged a whole host of
OL,15,Fother containers and within about five
OL,16,Fseconds, about 17 tonnes of nurdles
OL,17,Fwere emptied into the Tyne.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,F"I mean there was damage to the ship,
OL,8,Fbut actually the damage to the
OL,9,Fcontainers, it rips them open like a
OL,10,Fcan of beans."
OL,12,FPointing at the berthed BG Orange and
OL,13,Fcollapsed crane on the quayside, he
OL,14,Fexplained how the incident has
OL,15,F"profoundly affected" a lot of people
OL,16,Fworking at the port.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FHe said: "That vessel also hit our
OL,8,Fcontainer crane that was working this
OL,9,Fvessel and knocked the crane over,
OL,10,Fwith our operative actually in that
OL,11,Fcrane, about 115 foot in the air, so
OL,12,Fit was a pretty rough day for people.
OL,13,FThe operator has suffered multiple
OL,14,Fbroken bones, had an operation,
OL,15,Fthankfully recovering at home, but
OL,16,Fthis has profoundly affected a lot of
OL,17,Fpeople at the port, some of which are
OL,18,Fstill getting assistance now.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FFor locals who saw the plastic
OL,8,Fpellets, or nurdles, washing up on
OL,9,FTyneside's beaches, they have vented
OL,10,Ffrustration over what they claim was a
OL,11,Fdelay in response from the port.
OL,13,FOn Monday 3 August a group of
OL,14,Fvolunteers representing more than
OL,15,F2,000 residents who had helped in the
OL,16,Fclean-up effort on Tyneside's beaches,
OL,17,Fdelivered an open letter to the port
OL,18,Fboss, requesting access to the river
OL,19,Fto help with the next phase of the
OL,20,Fclean up at the site of the spill.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FWhen asked why it took the port three
OL,8,Fdays to deploy a boom barrier around
OL,9,Fthe struck vessel, Mr Beeton told ITV
OL,10,FNews it could only be done once it was
OL,11,Fsafe to do so.
OL,13,FHe added: "Well, we can't have people
OL,14,Fin the water, underneath unsafe
OL,15,Fcontainers, so it was essential that
OL,16,Fwhen we were able to get on that
OL,17,Fvessel, we were able to secure those
OL,18,Fcontainers to allow us to expedite
OL,19,Fthat boom as soon as we possibly
OL,20,Fcould, whilst keeping people safe.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,F"We can only act on something when we
OL,8,Fknow about it, and we knew about those
OL,9,Fnurdles on Monday, and by Tuesday we
OL,10,Fhad the global experts cleaning this
OL,11,Fstuff up."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FWhen asked about criticism claiming
OL,8,Fthe port had prioritised the crane
OL,9,Fsalvage operation over the immediate
OL,10,Fcontainment of the nurdles, he flatly
OL,11,Frejected it, and said: "I think that's
OL,12,Ftotally untrue, we had the global
OL,13,Fexperts here straight away. They were
OL,14,Fcleaning up the river. We had people
OL,15,Ffrom Holland flying over to try and
OL,16,Fget rid of the nurdles on the ship,
OL,17,Fand what people don't realise is we
OL,18,Fhad a 750 foot crane balancing on a
OL,19,Fship which was listing with every
OL,20,Fsingle tide.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,F"There were about 58 tonnes more
OL,8,Fnurdles on that ship and it was
OL,9,Fessential that we didn't let anymore
OL,10,Fgo into the river, or any other
OL,11,Fcontainers."
OL,13,FHe denied that deploying the boom
OL,14,Fearlier would have prevented more of
OL,15,Fthe nurdles entering the sea, claiming
OL,16,Fthe nurdles were in the water "in the
OL,17,Ffirst five seconds".
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FThe pace of the port's communication
OL,8,Fto the public about the spill and
OL,9,Fpotential pollution incident had also
OL,10,Fcome under scrutiny, despite South
OL,11,FTyneside Council issuing a press
OL,12,Frelease on Tuesday 21 July. Mr Beeton
OL,13,Fsaid the port had informed the local
OL,14,Fauthorities of the spill the day after
OL,15,Fthe spill - as soon as they knew about
OL,16,Fit - and that it was the councils who
OL,17,Fwere taking the lead on communications.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FHe said: "Well, we were in contact
OL,8,Fwith the councils on the Monday and we
OL,9,Fwere working with them about the comms
OL,10,Fand that's why on Monday you had
OL,11,Fsignage around the beaches. We'd been
OL,12,Ftalking to the councils, so we
OL,13,Fcoordinated our comms through them.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FWhen asked if he felt the public would
OL,8,Fhave been more understanding over the
OL,9,Fport's response had the communication
OL,10,Ffrom the port itself come out earlier
OL,11,Fthan four days after the spill, he
OL,12,Fsaid the priority was "making sure it
OL,13,Fdid not turn into an even bigger
OL,14,Fdisaster"
OL,16,FCadeler, the company which owns the
OL,17,FWind Orca, told ITV News: "Wind Orca
OL,18,Fhas resumed installation on the
OL,19,FHornsea 3 Offshore Wind Farm. This
OL,20,Ffollows clearance by all regulators."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,396,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1786370776
OL,3,CExclusive: Port of Tyne Nurdle spill
OL,4,Ctook 'five seconds' says Port of Tyne
OL,5,Cboss
OL,7,FCadeler added it is not in a position
OL,8,Fto comment further while the
OL,9,Finvestigation is ongoing.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the Marine Accident
OL,12,FInvestigation Branch (MAIB) said: "The
OL,13,FMarine Accident Investigation Branch
OL,14,Fhas been notified of an accident
OL,15,Finvolving the Wind Orca and BG Orange
OL,16,Fon the Tyne on Sunday 19 July. A team
OL,17,Fof inspectors has visited the site and
OL,18,Fa preliminary assessment of the
OL,19,Faccident has been commenced to recover
OL,20,Fevidence, and to determine the next
OL,21,Fsteps."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G14/14
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
